B.O1=s(["In 2026, educational researchers observed that students writing at 25 WPM retained 30% more conceptual information.","The human brain contains roughly 86 billion neurons, forming over 100 trillion synaptic connections throughout a lifetime.","Mount Everest reaches an altitude of 8,848 meters, with temperatures dropping below minus 35 degrees during winter.","Our solar system formed approximately 4.6 billion years ago from a massive rotating interstellar molecular cloud."],t.s)
B.O3=s(["There are 7 days in a week and 12 months in every year.","The school library has 5 big tables and 20 soft chairs.","We counted 10 bright stars and 2 birds in the morning sky.","A spider has 8 little legs and can spin 3 silk webs.","Our friendly team won 4 games out of 6 matches this term.","There are 24 hours in a full day and 60 minutes in an hour."],t.s)
B.O9=s(["The philosophical juxtaposition of kinetic dynamism and calligraphic poise exemplifies the synthesis of biomechanics and aesthetic discernment.","Epistemological inquiry presupposes that observed phenomena transcend subjective perception, requiring rigorous methodological empiricism.","Neuroplastic adaptations occurring during fine-motor penmanship exercises stimulate bilateral hemispheric communication within the cerebral cortex.","Architectural equilibrium requires harmonious symmetry, meticulous spatial cadence, and unyielding fidelity to structural integrity.","Literary eloquence emerges when profound philosophical depth coalesces effortlessly with crystalline typographic rhythm and syntactic precision."],t.s)
