B.Ok=s(["The Apollo 11 mission reached the Moon in 1969 after 4 days of flight.","Our science project recorded 25 plant species in the 3 acre school garden.","Earth travels around the Sun at about 30 kilometers every single second.","The local museum displays 150 ancient coins dating back to 300 BC.","Over 500 students participated in the annual 5 kilometer school run."],t.s)
