B.Ow=s(["Handwriting fluency develops through relaxed finger motion, consistent slant, and rhythmic stroke velocity.","Language allows human civilization to bridge historical distances, preserving thoughts across centuries with timeless grace.","True craftsmanship lies not in hurried execution, but in deliberate attention to proportion, curvature, and subtle balance.","Scientific inquiry demands curious observation, systematic hypotheses, and disciplined documentation of unexpected anomalies.","The architecture of an ancient library mirrors the intellectual heritage of scholars who cherished knowledge above worldly wealth.","When students cultivate patience, challenging concepts gradually transform into clear, elegant understanding."],t.s)
